---
const appUrl = 'https://app.biashara-pos.com';
---
<section class="hero hero-vision">
  <div class="wrap hero-center">
    <div class="brand-lockup reveal"><b>Biashara</b><i>POS</i></div>
    <div class="tagline reveal" data-en="Smart Business · Seamless Sales" data-sw="Biashara Bora · Mauzo Rahisi">Smart Business · Seamless Sales</div>
    <h1 class="reveal" data-en='One POS. <span class="grad">Every vertical.</span>' data-sw='POS moja. <span class="grad">Kila sekta.</span>'>One POS. <span class="grad">Every vertical.</span></h1>
    <p
      class="hero-sub reveal"
      data-en='A restaurant runs tables, a kitchen screen and recipe costs. A boutique runs variants and an online shop with delivery. A pharmacy runs batches and expiry. <b>Same system, same stock, same books.</b> <span class="sw">Biashara zako, mfumo mmoja.</span>'
      data-sw='Mgahawa unaendesha meza, skrini ya jikoni na gharama za mapishi. Boutique inaendesha aina za bidhaa na duka la mtandaoni lenye usafirishaji. Duka la dawa linaendesha bechi na tarehe za mwisho. <b>Mfumo mmoja, stoki moja, vitabu vilevile.</b> <span class="sw">Biashara zako, mfumo mmoja.</span>'
    >A restaurant runs tables, a kitchen screen and recipe costs. A boutique runs variants and an online shop with delivery. A pharmacy runs batches and expiry. <b>Same system, same stock, same books.</b> <span class="sw">Biashara zako, mfumo mmoja.</span></p>
    <div class="hero-cta reveal">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={appUrl} data-en="Start for Free →" data-sw="Anza Bila Malipo →">Start for Free →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="#modules" data-en="See the modules" data-sw="Ona moduli">See the modules</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-ticks reveal">
      <span class="tick"><span class="ic">✓</span><span data-en="Phone, POS terminal & computer" data-sw="Simu, terminal ya POS &amp; kompyuta">Phone, POS terminal &amp; computer</span></span>
      <span class="tick"><span class="ic">✓</span><span data-en="Counter sells without the network" data-sw="Kaunta inauza bila mtandao">Counter sells without the network</span></span>
      <span class="tick"><span class="ic">✓</span><span data-en="Real net profit per sale" data-sw="Faida halisi kwa kila mauzo">Real net profit per sale</span></span>
      <span class="tick"><span class="ic">✓</span><span data-en="Free up to 1,000 sales/mo" data-sw="Bure hadi mauzo 1,000/mwezi">Free up to 1,000 sales/mo</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
